cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Mapping & Service Finder — Demonstrator"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, static, client-side demonstrator implementing a ten-dimension
  taxonomy of urban manufacturing service offerings. It matches a stated demand
  against provider capabilities and reports a transparent, per-criterion verdict
  (met / not met / unknown), ranked by fewest mismatches. Seeded with a dataset of
  17 providers and 25 offerings in the Berlin area.
